prometheus (3.5.3+ds1-6~exp1) experimental; urgency=medium

  * Team upload.
  * Use go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.43.0 in tracing: otel 1.46.0
    sdk/resource uses semconv v1.43.0 and mismatching schema URLs make
    tracer provider setup fail with "conflicting Schema URL".
  * Build-Depend and have golang-github-prometheus-prometheus-dev depend
    on golang-opentelemetry-otel-dev (>= 1.46.0~) and
    golang-github-prometheus-alertmanager-dev (>= 0.33.1-5~), which is
    the first alertmanager-dev co-installable with otel-dev 1.46.0.

