prometheus (3.5.3+ds1-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Team upload.
  * Add distro patches for two more flaky cmd/prometheus tests:
    - TestHeadCompactionWhileScraping is timing-sensitive and failed on
      the riscv64 buildd; skip it in short mode, which Debian enables on
      slow architectures (armel, armhf, mips64el, riscv64).
      Ref: https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus/issues/17956
    - TestQueryLog is flaky due to an upstream port-binding race
      (connection refused / bind: address already in use on arm64 debci);
      disable until upstream fixes
      https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus/issues/16843

